{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Onimusha","An anime based on CAPCOM's legendary Sengoku period game: ONIMUSHA. The adaptation will have famed director Takashi Miike as the chief director of the series at animation studio Sublimation, while Shinya Sugai is directing the series. The anime will use the late prolific actor Toshiro Mifune as a model for the character Miyamoto Musashi.\n \n\n\nThe beginning of the Edo Period, Musashi is no longer a young man. He departs with the legendary  Oni Gauntlet to defeat the Genma.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network, Netflix, edited)"],"ja":["鬼武者",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-53150","ids":{"shikimori":53150,"mal":53150,"anilist":155015,"kodik":"serial-55233"},"kodikIds":["serial-55214","serial-55209","serial-55233"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-55214":"2023-11-03T06:30:34Z","serial-55209":"2023-11-02T10:55:51Z","serial-55233":"2023-11-03T18:27:00Z"},"title":"Онимуся","originalTitle":"Onimusha","alt":"Онимуша Onimusha 鬼武者","description":"Этот масштабный сериал расскажет о Миямото Мусаси Миямото, образ которого создан по мотивам Тосиро Мифунэ — легендарного японского актёра, известного во всём мире. Так начинается напряжённая история, полная реалистичного действия: клинок Мусаси разит зло, пока он странствует по земле, охваченной нищетой.","year":2023,"type":"ONA","genres":["Экшен","исторический","самураи"],"rating":6.55,"popularity":6667,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/53150/5901b41ec16a4c75b258d2c8d4b0d0ad.jpeg","width":675,"height":1000},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/155015-ULGT9av8Kxby.jpg","width":1642,"height":924}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-825","dubId":"825","label":"AniMaunt","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"p